{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20078","headline":"答姚怤见寄 · 孟郊","name":"答姚怤见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"日月不同光，昼夜各有宜。\n贤哲不苟合，出处亦待时。\n而我独迷见，意求异士知。\n如将舞鹤管，误向惊凫吹。\n大雅难具陈，正声易漂沦。\n君有丈夫泪，泣人不泣身。\n行吟楚山玉，义泪沾衣巾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20078.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20078","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}